# "Bigger cartridges" — the smallest banked cartridge there is: the code in the
# fixed region, the string in bank $01.
#
# A cart case runs in its own emulator, because a cartridge replaces the half
# of the address space the shared machine's BASIC prompt lives in.

cart 512K
timeout 20s

expect ^THIS LINE IS IN THE FIXED REGION$
expect ^AND THIS ONE IS IN BANK \$01$
